-- s 352(a)(1). Stockholders manage, are so divided that the business is suffering, and every remedy has failed: custodians.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `1 or more custodians under s 352(a)`
-- Insolvent as well: custodians and receivers.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `1 or more custodians, and, the corporation being insolvent, receivers, under s 352(a)`
-- A remedy in the agreement has not yet failed.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no appointment under s 352(a)`
-- The stockholders do not manage under s 351.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no appointment under s 352(a)`
-- s 352(a)(2). I have a right to dissolve under an s 355 provision.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `1 or more custodians under s 352(a)`
-- Not applying as a stockholder.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no appointment under s 352(a)`
-- No ground at all.
#ASSERT `Can I, as a stockholder, have the Court of Chancery appoint a custodian or receiver for my close corporation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no appointment under s 352(a)`

-- s 352(b). A custodian could be appointed and the Court finds a provisional director in the corporation's best interest.
